<view class="page-shell"><text class="page-title">我的相册</text><text class="page-subtitle">做过的图片和视频会放在这里。</text><view wx:if="{{!works.length}}" class="empty-state"><text class="empty-title">相册还是空的</text><text class="empty-copy">先用一张喜欢的照片，做第一份问候。</text><button class="primary-button empty-button" bindtap="goCreate">去制作</button></view><view wx:else class="work-list"><view wx:for="{{works}}" wx:key="id" class="work-item"><image class="work-image" src="{{item.previewPath}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="work-info"><text class="work-date">{{item.dateLabel}} · 图片草稿</text><text class="work-copy">{{item.copy}}</text><view class="work-actions"><button class="work-share" open-type="share" data-item="{{item}}">分享</button><button class="work-delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeWork">删除</button></view></view></view></view></view>
